    "head": "NJ TRANSIT is tracking a storm system bringing periods of heavy rain and gusty winds to New Jersey Thursday and into Friday. NJ TRANSIT rail tickets and passes will be cross honored by NJ TRANSIT Bus on Thursday, November 26 and Friday, November 27, 2026. Due to the postponement of the Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade, select NJ TRANSIT trains originally scheduled to provide additional service for the event on Thursday, November 26, will not operate. Please monitor njtransit.com and the NJ TRANSIT mobile app for updates."
